<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">Nabos Abik AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nabos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nabos Abik AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabos Abik AYohana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nabos Abik AYohana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Itarak kufumung e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Kufumung kang, kunung nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ aYeso Kristi kin tarak ina. Adakunom kin ku nɔk ina na a tonong basam Adakunom e nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ gbing-gbing ngmash ni in te. AYeso nye anɔng ni irèn itom fɛ́ a nɔɔk atomaza sak na asam wu aYohana. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />AYohana taas ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ a kin di fin in yet ifɛ̀ Adakunom nɛ atsak fɛ́ aYeso Kristi taas. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Awɛng Adakunom se na anet fɛ́ a fá ifɛ̀ Adakunom ni ikyɛng fi i bi te, awɛng Adakunom se na banet fɛ́ ba foos ide, na ba saas na ayɛ bá ikyɛng fɛ́ ba jɛk ni de, nek izeng e bɛ́ bakat.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow ni ite awɛng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Imi aYohana, in tsin jɛk sak na bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ ba se na narɔ inyis bafi ikuus kanakataat ni mben Asiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Won itek ni kusot kukyang fi ku nes na aYɔng fɛ́ a se yɔkɔnɔng, fɛ́ a kin se neme, fɛ́ a bi bɛ́, nɛ nabik kanakataat fɛ́ na se ashon kuta igwɔm wu, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />ngma nɛ aYeso Kristi, fɛ́ a yet afi kucɛɛt atsak, iwu fɛ́ a yet imɛsɛng ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba man donong ni irɛk, fɛ́ a yet agwɔm ngma bágwɔm azatse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Iwu fɛ́ a ki tonong yit ishim, a ki tun yit ayɛt anɛn yit nek inosong nasok wu, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />a mi sak in sot yit nnon igwɔm, nɛ áware fɛ́ ba ras Ada wu Adakunom kutomong, won iratek ni kukyem ni ku sot ku fuu ayɛ nɛ ayɛ! Anɔng.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Di yin, a bi bɛ́ ayɛt anɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">kaakyɛ ayisi bi ku di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">ngma na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">fɛ́ ba kin ku tusup.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Ngma banet azatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">bi nye kafa kawe nek iwu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Idɔng i bi te anɔng! Anɔng.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />ATisa Adakunom fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet Alfa nɛ aOmega<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikyɛng fi i yet: </char><char style="fk">Alfa nɛ aOmega</char> yet imɛsɛng ni igang e ni ilem baYahuda.</note>, aYɔng fɛ́ a se yɔkɔnɔng, aYɔng fɛ́ a kin se neme, aYɔng fɛ́ a bi bɛ́, aYɔng fɛ́ a wat akaangan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tonong aYohana <optbreak /> Anet-Isheshek na abik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Imi aruneng yin aYohana, afi ifiri ni iyin ayɛt izot ni igwɔm nɛ akabɔk itosok fi i yet ifɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se gung na aYeso. Imi wu fɛ́ ba kin tse ba di sak ni itsik izek aPatmos nek ishara ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ni kucɛɛt fi in raas naton aYeso. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ni kunom iya aTisa ntong kukak, Kabik Adakunom kin di sok, in da nin fok kutɔ gbɛrɛy ama hom ti kufi kugba, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />kutɔ me fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;Jɛk ikyɛng fi i di na kaban kpa ijɛk, tom ide sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nyis na narɔ kanakataat: sak na Afisa, nɛ aSimirna, nɛ aPagamum, nɛ aTayatira, nɛ aSardis, nɛ aFiladelfiya, nɛ aLaudikiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />In tirik nɔng in da di kutɔ fi ku tsin cɛɛt ni imi. Ama fi in mi tirik, in di atsɔm ata asɛng kanakataat fɛ́ ba di saas agaramun, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />wat nate atsɔm ata asɛng e, in di akak fɛ́ a se &lt;&lt;Tɛ Arim Anet,&gt;&gt; a mi te kugboo ikpin kukan fi ku tik sak na atas atak wu, a mi rosom kugwɔm wu ni kudun fɛ́ ba nye ne ata asɛng. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Ice wu nɛ akwey ice me tɛrɛk tɛ ulu, na natandɔrɔng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ijɛk afumung aGirik, ikyɛng fi i se ni jɛk azɔng yet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Tɛrɛk tɛ aSino.&gt;&gt;</char></note>, nɛ aca-yisi wu ron ti ilem irong. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Atak wu gyɛs tɛ ata agigɛl fɛ́ aron ayɛt árong, kutɔ wu se ti iwɔng ashi fɛ́ a tsin gosok. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />A bereng ádat kanakataat ni bɔk iyak wu, wat na awal fɛ́ a ya nabak nafaa wuru na nu wu. Ayisi wu ron ti kunom di ron makiyi.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Izen fi in ku di, in kpa aben natak wu ti in mi ku. A ma di sak kubɔk iyak wu naton in, a fɛ̀ ni mi: &lt;&lt;I bi fok nnyim awo. Imi yet afi imɛsɛng e, nɛ afi igang e. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Imi wu in yet Atset e; Imi kin ku, di yɔkɔnɔng in se ni kutset ayɛ nɛ ayɛ! Imi wu in bereng ícarak itarak katitu ikuu nɛ ari-irong.<verse eid="REV 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, jɛk ikyɛng fi i mi di, ikyɛng fi i se yɔkɔnɔng ni idɔng fi i resek dang te. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ ádat kanakataat fi ngɔn mi di ni bɔk iyak hom me ni ishɛn agaramun atsɔm asɛng kanakataat nyeseng naton nkyɔrɔk nà: Ádat kanakataat e yet batomaza fɛ́ ba se na narɔ inyis bafi ikuus aYeso kanakataat e, nɛ ishɛn agaramun atsɔm asɛng e yet bafi ikuus aYeso na narɔ kanakataat e.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na bafi <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />&lt;&lt;Jɛk sak na atomaza afi bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ ba se na Afisa fok:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:1">Kucɛɛt kang yet kufɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a bereng ádat kanakataat ni bɔk iyak wu, fɛ́ a tsees nate ishɛn agaramun kanakataat: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Imi rēn ntomong ngɔn, kugbagba ni inye nyɛk ngɔn. Imi rēn fok i da kyem iya kashon na ámaan ánet awo, ngɔn mi mara bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye fok iba yet batom aYeso awɛt ba yet awo, ngɔn mi di mbɔɔs bá. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ngɔn mi te nyɛk, imi nye akabɔk ni izot nek iyerek hom, i rangɔn dan te nwaa.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ngma na anɔng, in bi ikyɛng fi in da fɛ̀ naton ngɔn: Ngɔn mi wosong ishim fi i tsang di shim mo ni imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Yiring ni ishim fi i tsang bɛ́, dan ni i kpa! Tirik wosong anɛn ngɔn, kpa nyes nkyɔrɔk fi i man ni ras ni imɛsɛng. Ki da i ti tirik i wosong anɛn ngɔn awo, imi da bi in da sɛ, in da tun agaramun ngɔn narɔ fɛ́ a di se. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Awɛt nkyɔrɔk ntek na fi i nye: I rangɔn nggɔn baNikolaitiyan, kpaf kyɔn ti imi di ramin ina.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ ato, won na a wes ina ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom cɛɛt sak na bafi ikuus aYeso. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, imi bi ku nɔk irèn iya ica akon kakon fɛ́ ka nesek kutset, fɛ́ ka se ni igɔɔt Adakunom.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na banet <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aSimirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Jɛk sak na atomaza banet ikuus aYeso fɛ́ a se na aSimirna:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:8">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a yet afi imɛsɛng, a tɛ yet afi igang e, aYɔng fɛ́ a kin ku, a tɛ dorok ni kutset. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Imi rēn izot ngɔn, ni kukpɛt-kpɛt ngɔn, ngma na anɔng ngɔn yet arum! Imi rēn mbɔɔs bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye fok iba yet baYahuda, ba yet awo, ba yet karɔ iya ntong aShetan. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ngɔn bi fok nnyim mgbang fi i da sɔ awo, won in da tak, aMaan e da te bakak yin ari inyang nek a ki mara yin, i da sɔ yin izot nfi nkɔs kusɔk. Nyeseng yin na atsak sak ni iku, imi da ka nɔk itarang iya imara me.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, won na a fok ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus aYeso. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, vit kufot fi ku bi ku sɛ ni iku ifɛ́ afaa.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na banet <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aPagamum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />&lt;&lt;Jɛk sak na atomaza bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ a se na aPagamum:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:12">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a bereng awal fɛ́ a ya votot nabak nafaa. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Imi rēn karɔ isot ngɔn, karɔ fi kuta igwɔm aShetan di se. Ngma na anɔng, ngɔn nyeseng na atsak ni iyerek hom. Ngɔn nyeseng na tsak ngɔn, sak ni nnom fɛ́ ba kin di fɛt Antipas atitup asam hom ama iwɔp, karɔ fɛ́ aShetan di se.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ngma na anɔng, in bi ikyɛng fi i di daam ni ngɔn: Ngɔn bɛ́ banet azɔng fɛ́ ba yit itees aBalaam, iwu fɛ́ a kin tees aBalak na wɔrɔk banet aIsrela sak ni ira inɛn iya nayak fɛ́ ba mi nabak-akuce sak na nabannom e, ni ras kujang. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ngɔn ti i bɛ́ banet fɛ́ ba bereng itees baNikolaitiyan fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ni itees mbɔɔs. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Tirik won anɛn ngɔn! Ke da anɔng awo, ngmash ni in bɛ́ azɔng, in da kɔn ni iba ni kutsot fi ku se na nu hom.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Won ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, na a fok ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara, in da ku nɔk akpam fɛ́ a ne azanɛn. In da ti in ku nɔk kuta kukan ni iyerek ifas fɛ́ ba di jɛk ni ko, idɔng fɛ́ ma ayɔng fɛ́ a bereng iko kyɛk fɛ́ a da rēn ide.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na banet <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aTayatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Jɛk sak na atomaza banet ikuus aYeso fɛ́ a se na aTayatira:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:18">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifi Nggon Adakunom, aYɔng fɛ́ aca-yisi wu se ti mgbey kurong, aYɔng fɛ́ atak wu se tɛ kutsɔm kukan fi ku ron. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Imi rēn ntomong ngɔn, ni ishim ngɔn, nɛ atsak ngɔn, ni ikyɛng fi ngɔn raas, nɛ akabɔk ngɔn. Imi rēn ikyɛng fi i di se ne yɔkɔnɔng, iwat idɔng fi i tsang raas ni imɛsɛng e.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ngma na anɔng, imi bi ikyɛng fi i di daam ni ngɔn: Ngɔn nɔɔk abining yɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes aJezebel kawat, ayɔng fɛ́ a nye fok iwu yet atan Adakunom. Nek itees wu, a mi tes basam hom na tse, ni iras kujang ni iya nayak fɛ́ ba nasap-akuce sak na nabannom e. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />In mi ku nɔɔk izen nek na tirik na won anɛn kujang wu, awɛt a shim awo. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Nek anɔng, in da ku barak na meneng mgbang, in da sak bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kujang ni wu na ba sɔ izot gyet awo, tit ma ba tirik ba wosong ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ras ni wu. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Imi da carak nnon ikuus wu na na kus ni nrɔk. Na anɔng, ngma itusung bafi ikuus aYeso da rēn fok imi wu in yere ayɛ ni iyiring banet, in da tarang kaangan ayɛt yin kpaf ni ntomong fɛ́ a ras. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Sak ni ishɛrɛp yin fi i se yin na aTayatira, iyin fi da ishan yin itees wu awo, da ishan yin itees aShetan fɛ́ ba yes iye ikyɛng inɛt awo, imi da ti in ki te yin kunanang kukak awo, <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />tit, yit yin atsak yin gyat ma kubɛ́ hom.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, na nye ikyɛng fi iyet kushim hom sak ni gang e, in bi ku nɔk kukyem azaton icɛn azatse.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />A bi ya igwɔm naton ba ni ishɛn kutsɔm;</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="REV 2:27">a bi ka ba fo abak-abak e tɛ nadonong,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Abom 2:9</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="mi" vid="REV 2:27">kyɔn ti imi di shan kukyem na Ada min. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />In bi ti in ku nɔk àdat isɛng atson. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, na a fok ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus aYeso!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na bafi <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aSardis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Sak na atomaza afɛ́ itusung bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ ba se na aSardis:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a bereng nabik kanakataat na fɛ́ Adakunom, na ádat kanakataat bà. Imi rēn ntomong yin; banet fɛ́ ngɔn yet atset, ashit awish i yet kukom e. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Shemeng! Di barang agap ikyɛng fi i kyɛk fɛ́ ngmash ni iku, nek in mi sɛ ntomong ngɔn mi shining ashon Adakunom hom awo. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Nek anɔng, yiring ni ifɛ́ fi i kin sɛ ni idɔng fi i kin fok; di kuus ide, tirik won anɛn ngɔn. Awɛt ki i rangɔn dang shemeng, in da bɛ́ tɛ akpatang, ngɔn da rēn izen fi in di ki bɛ́ awo.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ngma ne anɔng, ishɛrɛp banet di se gyet na aSardis fɛ́ da ba mi gbiridik ares bá awo. Ba bi tsees ni imi, ba bi tes nkpiin nkan, nek in ka ba di ba kyem. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, ba bi ku te kukpin kukan ti iba ba. Imi bi fuut iyerek wu ni kufumung ayerek bafi kutset awo, tit in bi tak iyerek wu ayet anaan ashon Ada hom nɛ batomaza wu. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, won na a fok ifɛ́ fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus aYeso ne.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na banet <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aFiladelfiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Sak na atomaza bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ ba se na aFiladelfiya:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:7">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a yet ajɛrɛ nɛ atsak, iwu fɛ́ a bereng amakuli aDauda. Ikyɛng fɛ́ a tarak, vit anet fɛ́ a kyem ifam me, ikyɛng fɛ́ a fam, vit anet itarak e. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />In rēn ntomong ngɔn. Di, in mi da won katitu piyot fɛ́ vit anet ifam e. In rēn fok agap ngɔn se gyeet, ngma na anɔng, ibereng ifɛ̀ hom, ira nanan iyerek hom awo. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />In da sak bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafi karɔ iya aShetan ntong, fɛ́ ba nye fok iba yet baYahuda awɛt i se anɔng awo, tit bafi mbɔɔs. Imi da ka ba sak na men pak ashon ngɔn, na ba fɛ̀ ey imi da shim. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Nek ngɔn bereng ifɛ̀ ayɛt akabɔk, imi bi da bereng ni izen imara fi i bi kpa kazatse ngma kusum, nek imara bayɔng fɛ́ ba se azatse.<verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Imi yɔng ngmash ni in bɛ́. Bereng ikyɛng fi imi sɛ, kɔn akak bi shan abong igwɔm ngɔn. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, in bi ku sak na sot itsik karɔ iya Adakunom hom ntong. Da a da tɛ won ika awo. In bi jɛk iyerek Adakunom hom natoon wu, ni iyerek kuwɔp Adakunom hom, aRushelima afas, fɛ́ bi ne azanɛn narɔ Adakunom hom, imi bi jɛk iyerek hom ifas natoon wu. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, won na a fok ifɛ́ fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus aYeso.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumung sak na banet <optbreak /> ikuus aYeso na aLaudikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Jɛk sak na atomaza bafi ikuus aYeso fɛ́ ba se na aLaudikiya:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:14">Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ ba ku yes Anɔng, ayɔng fɛ́ a tak na shining, afi icɛɛt atsak, afi iya igwɔm azaton nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom nye. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />In rēn ntomong ngɔn, da i se cɛre ke mɔɔ awo. Kaa! Ki i fi se cɛre ke mɔɔ ayi. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Nek ngɔn se tungut anɔng, da i se cɛre ke mɔɔ awo, ngmash ni da cik nanu hom. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ngɔn nye fok, &lt;Imi yet arum; in mi tusung kurúm, in tin tsɛt ikikak awo.&gt; Awɛt ngɔn rēn fok ngɔn sɛ kpɛt-kpɛt, ikyɛng angmishish, akan, akpatɔn, i se kpiip. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />In tsin da nɔɔk itabak, shan kutsɔm kuseng ni mi fɛ́ ba mi ruk iko ni rong, nɔng i da bin sot arum; na ares akan fi i da tes, nɔng i di ki fam nsum kusot kpiip ngɔn, shan ikan ayisi, nɔng i di ki yɛrɛ yɛɛt.<verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Banet fi i mi shim, iba ba in kaba kɔrɔng ni in kaba tabak. Nek anɔng, tonong atsak, tirik, won anɛn ngɔn. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Imi yong ni inyeseng atitu, in tsin tsot ika. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fok kutɔ hom, a tarak ika, in da nɔ ayɛt e, in da yas ni iwu ni iwu yas ni imi.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a ya imara me, in da ku nɔk irèn isonong ni kuta igwɔm hom ni imi, kyɔn ti imi kin di ya awɛng in sonong gung na Ada hom ni ita igwɔm wu. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuto, won na fok ifɛ̀ fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom tsin taas bafi ikuus aYeso&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">AYohana di fɛ́ ba tsin ya <optbreak /> Adakunom Ntong aZanɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ama anɔng, in di katitu ashon hom ni itarak azanɛn. Kutɔ fi in tun fok kucɛɛt ni mi se ti kugba ku fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Bɛ aze, nda ka tonong ikyɛng fi i da te ama ideng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ni izen izining, Kabik Adakunom di sok, in di kuta igwɔm ashon hom azanɛn na akak ni sonong naton e. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />AYɔng fɛ́ a sonong naton e se tɛ ata itsɔm fɛ́ a gyɛs fɛ́ ba yes ina ye ajasfa nɛ akarneliya. Kata-iza fɛ́ ka tas aemeral, te kuta igwɔm e nate. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ata igwɔm akak nsɔk nfaa ina anaas te ata igwɔm e nate, bashɔn nsɔk nfaa ina anaas di sosok ni na. Ba tes ares akan, ba sɛ na ábong igwɔm fɛ́ ba nye na átsɔm asɛng na ace bá. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Nrong nes ni kuta igwɔm e, in nye dɛbɛt ni mgbey ni iwɔng izá. Ashon kuta igwɔm e, agaramun kanakataat ya kurong azɔng. Agaramun e yɔng a sot akuce nabik Adakunom kanakataat. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ikyɛng kak se azɔng ashon kuta igwɔm e ti kukyɛk fɛ́ ba nye iko na agyilas, gyiri makiyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Nate, nɛ ni fam kuta igwɔm e, nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas e te iko nate, nkyɔrɔk ntset e bɛ́ ayisi ngma kusum, ashon nɛ kama. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ikyɛng ifi imɛsɛng e tas akukum, ifɛ́ afaa tas kamung, ifɛ́ ataat sok ayisi anet awe, ifɛ́ anaas se tɛ akim. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas fɛ́ ba nye me bɛ akufabak karataat fɛ́ a di doro ni ina, na ayisi ngma kusum akak ayɛt akufabak e. Katuk ni kunom, ba won dang nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ajɛrɛ, ajɛrɛ, ajɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">yet aTisa Ada Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">fɛ́ a se neme, a se yɔkɔnɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">a bi tɛ bɛ́.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ngma izen fɛ́ nkyɔrɔk ntset e nɔɔk itere, iratek ni ifeng sak na aYɔng fɛ́ a sosok naton kuta igwɔm e, fi kutset wu se vit nkum. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />Na bashɔn nsɔk nfaa ni na anaas e kpas pak aben ashon aYɔng fɛ́ a sosok naton ita igwɔm e, na ba ya ntong sak na aYɔng fɛ́ a se ayɛ ne ayɛ. Na ba saas abong igwɔm bá ashon kuta igwɔm e na ba nye:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />&lt;&lt;ATisa yit nɛ Adakunom yit, ngɔn wu kyem, ni ishan itere, ni iratek, ni kukyem, nek ngɔn wu i nye ngma nkyɔrɔk, ni kushim ngɔn wu i nye ina, ibereng ina ni kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">AYohana di Kukpa ijɛk ni <optbreak /> Itsamang Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Wat in di kaban kpa ijɛk ni bɔk iyak aYɔng fɛ́ a sonong ni kuta igwɔm e. Kukpa ijɛk e bi ijɛk ni ko nabak e nafaa, ba di bas na nagang-ace-igwɔm kanakataat. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />In di agbat atomaza na tsin cɛɛt ni kutɔ gbɛrɛy, &lt;&lt;Angan wu a da kyem a ngamang nagang-ace-igwɔm e, na di tarak kaban kpa ijɛk e yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Awɛt vit akak azanɛn, ke azatse, ke aben na kazatse, fɛ́ a kyem a ngamang ke na a tarak kaban kpa ijɛk e ke na a yɛrɛk kayɛt e ayi. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />In ya ának nek vit ayɔng fɛ́ ba kyem ba sɛ fɛ́ a kyem a tarak kaban kpa ijɛk e na di kayɛt e awo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Awɛt azining ayɛt bashɔn e fɛ́ ni mi, &lt;&lt;I bi tos awo! Di, akukum afi icɛn aYahuda, afi izɔrɔk aDauda, mi ya imara. Iwu da kyem a ngamang nagang-ace-igwɔm kanakataat e, na a tarak kaban kpa ijɛk e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />In wat in di Itsamang, i se tɛ ba mi tsɛt iye, ni inyeseng nate kuta igwɔm e, nkyɔrɔk ntset nnas nɛ bashɔn e te iye nate. I bɛ́ atom kanakataat nɛ ayisi kanakataat, fɛ́ a yet nabik Adakunom kanakataat fɛ́ ba tom ina sak azatse ngma kusum. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />I bɛ́, a sok kaban kpa ijɛk e ni bɔk iyak ayɔng fɛ́ a sonong ni kuta igwɔm e. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ama fɛ́ a mi sok kaban kpa ijɛk e, nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas e nɛ bashɔn nsɔk nfaa kpa aben ashon Itsamang e. Kaangan ba berese izom ni ítsɛ́n fɛ́ ba nye na atsɔm asɛng, ba di shining nkyɔrɔk nkɔn ntek fi in yet awon banet Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Ba ra abom afas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Ngɔn wu fi i kyem isok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kaban kpa ijɛk e, ni ngamang</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">nagang-ace-igwɔm e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nek ba kin da fɛt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ne nasok ngɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ngɔn mi shan kutset banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">sak na Adakunom, fɛ́ ba nes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ni nri zizɛɛt, ni icɛ́n zizɛɛt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ne ni mben azatse zizɛɛt.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Ngɔn mi ka ba sak ba sot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">igwɔm ne áware, nek ba di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">ra Adakunom kutomong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">ba da ya igwɔm naton azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ama anɔng, in yɛrɛk in fok kutɔ batomaza hwyɛt, kudot ba, agup naton agup, agup kusɔk ite agup kusɔk. Ba te kuta igwɔm e nate ni nkyɔrɔk ntset nɛ bashɔn e. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ba ra abom ni ntɔ nratek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Itsamang fɛ́ ba fɛt e, a kyem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">na a sɛ iratek, ni kurúm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ni kutsitsɛng, ni kukyem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">ni ízɔk, ni iratek, ni itere!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Wat in fok kaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye azanɛn, nɛ azatse, nɛ aben na kazatse, nɛ ayɛt ashi, ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt na, ba ra abom, &lt;&lt;Won itere, ni iratek, ni ízɔk, ni kukyem, ni ku sot kufɛ́ aYɔng fɛ́ a sosok nita igwɔm ni Itsamang e, ayɛ nɛ ayɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Nkyɔrɔk ntset nnas fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Anɔng!&gt;&gt; Bashɔn e kpa aben ba ya ntong bà.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Itsamang Adakunom e ka <optbreak /> ngamang nagang-ace-igwɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ama anɔng, in di te ayisi ni Kitsamang e tsin ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm ifi imɛsɛng ayɛt kanakataat e. Wat in fok azining ayɛt nkyɔrɔk ntset nnas e fɛ́rɛ́ng ni kutɔ ti íza, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />In yɛrɛk, in di itsaap ikan ashon hom! AYɔng fɛ́ a ngarak iye bereng kata, wat ba ku nɔk abong igwɔm, asɔkɔ ni iye tɛ agwɔm itsom fɛ́ a tse a ya itsom.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ama anɔng, Kitsamang e tɛ a ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm e ifɛ́ faa, in fok ikyɛng itsɛt ifɛ́ afaa fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Ama anɔng, itsaap ikak wuruk, isɛng kyiu. Ayɔng fɛ́ a ngarak iye, ba ku nɔɔk agap itun kukyang azatse, na a sak banet na ba fɛɛs ice bá. Ba ku nɔk iwu kunyin kutsot.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ama anɔng, Kitsamang e ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm e ifɛ́ ataat, in fok ikyɛng itsɛt ifɛ́ taat e fɛ́rɛ́ng, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; In yɛrɛk, in di itsaap iwe ashon yin! Ayɔng fɛ́ a ngarak e, a bereng ikyɛng imaas kunanang ni bɔk wu. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ama anɔng, in fok ikikak shim ti kutɔ nate nkyɔrɔk ntset nnas e. Ku fɛ́ fok, &lt;&lt;Itsɛn imaas alikama izining kyɛk naton itsɔm iwoso kutomong anet. Ni itsɛn imaas abale itaat kyɛk naton itsɔm iwoso kutomong anet. Awɛt i bi beseng yin name nɛ ashi anap e awo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ama anɔng, Kitsamang e ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm e ifɛ́ anaas, in fok kutɔ ikyɛng itsɛt naas fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />In yerek, in di itsap fi i se kpɛlɛk ashon yin! Ayɔng fɛ́ a ngarak iye ba ku yes Iku. Karɔ isosok bafaben ku kuus mo ama. Ba ka ba nɔk agap ifɛɛs asa anaas afɛ́ banet azatse ni kutsot, ni nzong, ni izot, ni inyam ayit azatse.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ama anɔng, a ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm ifɛ́ atoon, In di kaben ni kuta ashosh e, ni ntset bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ka ba fɛɛs nek ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ni inyeseng naton itaas ifɛ̀ Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Ba yes ni kutɔ kuratek, &lt;&lt;Wo aTisa fi i bi ízɔk, nɛ ajɛrɛ nɛ atsak, sak akyi izen, fi i bi ni ra banet kazatse ishɔt, ni ka ba zoot nek inos nasok yit ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ba nesek kaangan ba kugboo kukpin kukan, ba fɛ̀ ni iba na ba bang tot ninyɛn nfi kizen gyet, ma ba shining kudot bafidang itomong nɛ baruneng bá fɛ́ ba da fɛs kyɔn tɛ ba kin ka ba fɛs iba.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Kitsamang e ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm ifɛ́ karataat, wat in di, ba nye agbat izuut mben ikak. Kunom wat ku bun kuwe tɛ agbidik áres fɛ ba nye na akwey ibon iwe, kufɛn wat ku sot kuseng tɛ nasok. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Ádat aton aza kpas sak azatse, tɛ ica atafo di kpas ki kuwun agap zuut kakon e. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Kaza wat ka te bit tɛ ba kunung kushit, ba tun kaakyi ihwyanang ni izek narɔ ye.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ama anɔng, bágwɔm azatse, ni nnon ari igwɔm, nɛ agbat batsom, nɛ barum, nɛ agbat banet, nɛ basam, nɛ bawashak, nesɛk ice bá ayɛt asɔs, ne ayɛt ahwyanang. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Ba nye na ahwyanang nɛ ata, &lt;&lt;Di kpas yin naton yit, ki fam yit ni idi ayisi aYɔng fɛ́ a sosok naton kuta igwɔm, nɛ iyɛ-ifɛ Kitsamang e! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Nek agbat kunom iyɛ-ifɛ Adakunom ni Kitsamang e mi nye, angan da kyem a nyeseng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Ba bi sheshek banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ama ideng, in di batomaza banaas ni nyeseng na atsok azatse anaas, ba tɛnɛng nwun na atsok azatse anaas, kɔng in bi fɛsɛm ke na a beseng mben, ke izek, ke nakon awo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ama anɔng, in ti in di atomaza akak na tsin ngarak abace, a bereng nagang-ice-igwɔm Adakunom fɛ́ ayet atset. Ni kutɔ kuratek, a yes batomaza banaas e, fɛ́ ba mi ka ba nɔk agap ibeseng mben ni izek. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />A fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;I bi beseng yin mben, ke izek, ke nakon ninyen awo, ma in di te nagang-ice-igwɔm Adakunom na natii basam Adakunom yit ninyen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Wat in fok kudot bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba te nagang-ice-igwɔm Adakunom: agup anakat azining ni nsɔk nnaas nɛ anaas (144,000) fɛ́ ba nes ni icɛn aIsrela.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">aYahuda fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">aRuben fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">aGad fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">Asha fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">aNaftali fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">aManase fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">aSimiyɔn fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">aLawi fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">aIsaka fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">aZebulum fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">aYusufu fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne ni izɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">aBanyami fɛ́ ba di te</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">nagang-ice-igwɔm ba se banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">agup kusɔk abe afaa (12,000).<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugbat Kudyɛng banet <optbreak /> fɛ́ ba tes ágboo ákpin akan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ama anɔng, in yɛrɛk, in di kugbat kudyɛng banet fɛ́ vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem a fa ashon hom, ba nes ni mben zizɛɛt, ni icɛn zizɛɛt, ni izɔrɔk zizɛɛt nɛ alem zizɛɛt, ni nyeseng ashon kuta igwɔm e, nɛ ashon Kitsamang Adakunom. Ba tes agboo akpin akan, ba berese ahwyang izizerek ni mbɔk bá. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Ba tang ntɔ gbɛrɛy na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">&lt;&lt;Isheshek yit nes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">na Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">iwu fɛ́ a sosok naton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">kuta igwɔm, ni kitsamang e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ngma batomaza me, nɛ bashɔn e, ni nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas e te kuta igwɔm e nate. Ba kpas pak aben ashon kuta igwɔm e, na ba ya Adakunom ntong, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">&lt;&lt;Anɔng! Itere ni ízɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">ni kutsitsɛng, ni ifeng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ni iratek, ni kukyem, ne agap</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">ni in sot nfɛ́ Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">ayɛ nɛ ayɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Anɔng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Awɛt azining ayɛt bashɔn e di rip fok, &lt;&lt;Ba bá fɛ́ ba tes agboo ákpin akan nà, ba yet bangan ɛ? Ba ne akɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Awɛt imi fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, ngɔn wu i rēn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Iwu ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ba bang yet banet fɛ́ ba wuruk ayɛt aduk izot; ba mi kusu nkpin bá, na nasok Kitsamang e in sot nkan. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nek anɔng wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">&lt;Fɛ́ ba di nyeseng ashon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">kuta igwɔm Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">ba ku ya ntong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">katuk ni kunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">nitu iya ntong wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Iwu fɛ́ a sosok naton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">kuta igwɔm e, bi ka ba fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">ni kubut wu.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Vit i ti ifok nzong ni ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">vit i ti ifok iyɛ ngash ni ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Kunom bi ti ku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">ka ba shosh awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">ke ikikak i ti ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">ba ta vɛt awo.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Nek Kitsamang fɛ ka se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">nate kuta igwɔm e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">bi sot anek bá.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Iwu bi tsees ni iba ni ikang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">fi i nesek ashi kutset.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Adakunom bi ka ba rɛng ngma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">nayisi fɛ́ na se na yisi bá.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kitsamang e ngamang <optbreak /> nagang-ice-igwɔm <optbreak /> Adakunom kanakataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ama fɛ́ Kitsamang e ngamang nagang-ice-igwɔm ifɛ́ kanakataat e, karɔ te yuu azanɛn nfi ibit agyip azining.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Wat in di batomaza kanakataat e ni nyeseng ashon Adakunom, ba ka ba nɔk ágbá kanakataat.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Atomaza akak fɛ́ a bereng kitsɛ̀n ifung atseng nkɔn ntek, a bɛ́ a nyeseng ashon kuta ashosh e. Ba ku nɔk nkyɔrɔk atseng nkɔn ntek dot, nɛ áwon banet Adakunom, naton kuta ashosh e, ashon kuta igwɔm e. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Ntseng nkɔn ntek e, na awon banet Adakunom e, ne ni bɔk atomaza me, a ngarak sak ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ama anɔng, atomaza me, sok kitsɛ̀n ifung atseng nkɔn ntek e, a bɔ itsɛn irong ni kuta ashosh e a di shining ni itsɛn e, a ziming iko sak azatse; wat karɔ rumung, na ka nye dɛbɛt ni izá tasak, ni mben zuut.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifɛsɛm ágbá kanakataat e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Ama anɔng, batomaza kanakataat fɛ́ ba berese ágbá kanakataat e, kana nye nek ifɛsɛm e.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Atomaza imɛsɛng e, fɛɛp kugba wu, wat itarang kpa nes, ni kurong fɛ́ ba di kyere nɛ nasok, ba ziming iko sak azatse. Kurong e ya asa azining ayɛt ataat afɛ́ azatse, nɛ azining ayɛt asa ataat afɛ́ nakon, kurong ya, ngma agam kurong ya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Atomaza afɛ́ afaa me, fɛɛp kugba ku fuu, ikyɛng kak ti kunyin kuhwyanang fi kurong se ni iya me, ba barak ide ayɛt izek. Asa azining ayɛt ataat afi izek tirik sak na nasok, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />asa azining ayɛt ataat afi nkyɔrɔk ntset fi in se ayɛt izek kus, nasa azining ayɛt ataat afɛ́ akye-ashi beseng.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Atomaza afɛ́ ataat e, fɛɛp kugba ku fuu, agbat àdat akak, fɛ́ aron gbey tɛ agaramun, ne azanɛn a kpa naton asa azining ayɛt ataat afɛ́ ákyɛk nɛ ákang ashi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Ba yes àdat e yɔng, &lt;&lt;Kpashak.&gt;&gt; Asa azining ayɛt ataat afɛ́ ashi, tirik a te kpashak, banet dot kus nek ashi fɛ́ a te kpashak e.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Atomaza afɛ́ naas e, fɛɛp kugba ku fuu, ba hwyerek asa azining ayɛt ataat afi kunom, ni asa azining ayɛt ataat afi kufɛn, nɛ asa azining ayɛt ataat afi ádat, te kurin, ni mgbey inom, ni nfɛ́ atuk, nɔ ni rin bá.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />In se ni iyɛrɛ, in fok nawoot i tsi kukim kukak naton aza, ku fɛ́rɛ́ng ni kutɔ gbɛrɛy fok: &lt;&lt;Ye kukuu! Ye kukuu! Banet fɛ́ ba se ni kusot azatse da nɔ ni izot, nek ágba fɛ́ batomaza bataat da fɛsɛm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Atomaza afɛ́ atoon e, fɛɛp kugba ku fuu, in di àdat fɛ́ a ne azanɛn a kpa azatse. Ba nɔɔk àdat e kufet itarak katitu kubong fi kutsik ku se vit nkum. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Nizen fɛ́ àdat e tarak kubong fi kutsik ko se vit nkum e, ntseng ne ayɛt e tɛ atseng fɛ́ a ne na arɔ iruk. Kunom nɛ kaza wat ka te hwyinin nek ntseng fi in ne ni ibong e. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Kubep wuru ayɛt ntseng e, ni ku tisik sak azatse, ba nɔk iko agap ti ifi inyáng azatse. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Ba fɛ̀ ni de da i bi beseng agam azatse, ki ikikak fɛ́ ba tup ke kakon awo tit banet fɛ́ ba se vit nagang-ice-igwɔm Adakunom na natii bá kyɛk. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Da ba ki de nɔɔk agap ifɛs ba awo, tit ni i ka ba zoot sak nfɛn ntoon. Kurɔ me se kpaf ti kufi inyáng ki i ta anet. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Ni nnom e yɔng, banet bi tsɛt iku, wɛt ba bi sɛ ide awo; ba bi tsɛt iku, iku bi ka ba raba.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Kubep e se ti ítsáp fɛ́ ba da tse itsom ni de. Ba ki de te ikyɛng kak tɛ abong igwɔm afɛ́ itsɔm asɛng ni ice, ayisi de tas afɛ́ banet awe. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Na akwey ice de se tɛ afɛ́ banyining, anyi de se tɛ afɛ́ akukum. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ba tɛnɛsɛ ágɔm na ni ikpat itsɔm, iwɔng áfabak de se ti iwɔng kubut-atak itsees ni itsaap fɛ́ a se ni isɔkɔ sak narɔ itsom. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />A bɛ́ árum, a tang ti inyáng, ayɛt árum na a bɛ́ agap izoot banet kurɔm sak nfɛn ntoon. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />A bɛ́ agwɔm, fɛ́ a yet atomaza fɛ́ a bi ízɔk naton kubong fi kutsik ku se vit nkum, fɛ́ ba ku yes ni ilem baYahuda Abadon, ni icɛn aGirik, Apoliyɔn.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Izot ifi imɛsɛng mi got; izot ifaa resek dang bɛ́.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Atomaza afɛ́ karataat fɛɛp kugba ku fuu, in fok kutɔ fi ku ne ni atsok anaas afɛ́ átom kuta ashosh afɛ́ itsɔm asɛng fɛ́ a se ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Kutɔ me fɛ̀ na atomaza me afɛ́ karataat e fɛ́ a bereng kugba me, &lt;&lt;Bisik batomaza banaas fɛ́ ba ka ba rosom ni kugbat kukyɛk aYuferetis.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Wat batomaza banaas, fɛ́ ba ka ba won nek izen ne yeng, nek kunom e kang, ni kufɛn e kang, ni iyɛ me deng, ba ka ba bisik mok ifɛs asa azining ayɛt ataat kudot banet azatse. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Kudot bafi isɔkɔ me se amile anakat afaa. In fok kudot bá.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ítsaap nɛ bafi isɔkɔ fi in di na nabos abik hom e se ane: a bi ikpat fɛ́ ba tes na ágɔm yet asɛng kyiu, nɛ agyigyɛl nɛ ashi ariron. Ice ítsaap e tas ice akukum, kurong nɛ atseng nɛ abing-irong-iruk, wuru na nu de. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Asa azining ayɛt ataat kudot banet azatse kus nek izot itaat ifi kurong deng, nɛ atseng ni nkɔn fi in nes na nu de. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Agap ítsaap e se na nu de nɛ árum na; nek árum na se ti ihwyen, a bi ice fɛ́ a di nesek banet izot.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Nshɛrɛp banet fɛ́ da ba kus nek izot e awo, ba raba dang tirik na ba won anɛn bá; da ba won iya itseng ntong awo, nɛ nabannom fɛ́ ba nye na itsɔm asɛng, nɛ afɛ́ itsɔm akan, nɛ afɛ́ itsɔm awe, nɛ ata, nɛ ákon fɛ́ da a yɛrɛ, ke a foos, ke a tsees awo. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Ke raba dang tirik na ba won anɛn bá, nek ikok ntset, ni kubok bá, ni iras kujang bá, ni itsang fɛ́ ba ras awo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Atomaza nɛ kaban kpa ijɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Wat in di agbat atomaza a tisik azanɛn. Anɔk ku kunung, ne kata-iza naton ice wu; ayisi wu ron ti kunom, atak wu se tɛ atsik kurong. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />A bereng kaban kpa ijɛk, fɛ́ ka se ni itarak ni bɔk wu. A sak kutak iyak wu ayɛt izek, ni kufi imen wu naton mben. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />A ta kukun ti kufɛ́ akukum. Ni izen fɛ́ a ta kukun e, ntɔ izá kanakataat e wat in shan. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ama fi izá kanakataat e fɛ́rɛ́ng, in shim ki in kpa ijɛk; awɛt in fok kutɔ fi ku ne azanɛn, fi ku fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Nɛt ikyɛng fi izá me fɛ̀, i bi jɛk ide awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Wat atomaza fi in mi tsang di ni nyeseng naton izek nɛ naton mben e, nabak kubɔk iyak wu sak azanɛn. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Ashiwu ni iyerek ayɔng fɛ́ a bi kutset ayɛ ne ayɛ, fɛ́ a nye kazanɛn ngma ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt ka, a nye kazatse ngma ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt e, a nye izek ngma ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt e, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Vit ishɛrɛp ibeseng izen! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Awɛt ni nnom fɛ́ atomaza afi kanakataat shim a fɛɛp kugba wu, ba bi shining nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom kin sak ni nɛt, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ a kin tak basam wu batan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Wat kutɔ fi ku ne azanɛn e ban ti ku fɛ̀ ni mi: &lt;&lt;Tsi shan kukpa ijɛk fi ku se ni itarak ni bɔk atomaza fɛ́ a nyeseng kutak kukak na izek kukak ni mben e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nek anɔng, in tse na atomaza me, in fɛ̀ ni wu na di nɔk kaban kpa ijɛk e. A fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;Shan iko, ya iko. Ku da sak kafa ngɔn kpashak, ngma na anɔng, i da fok rɔrɔtɔt nanu ngɔn ti itong.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />In shan kaban kpa ijɛk e ni bɔk atomaza me, in ya ika. In fok rɔrɔtɔt nanu hom, awɛt fi in mi ya ika, kafa hom te kpashak. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ama anɔng, ba fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;&lt;Ise gbingbing ni ti itaas ifɛ́ Adakunom sak ni mben zizɛɛt, nɛ alem dot, ni ícɛ́n zizɛɛt, nɛ bágwɔm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Bafɛ́ anu icɛɛt atsak bafaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ba di nɔk ikyɛng kak ti ishɛn imaas, ba fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;&lt;Tsi maas kutu iya Adakunom ntong ni kuta ashosh e, fa banet iya ntong fɛ́ ba se azɔng. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Awɛt won katasa me, da i bi maas ika awo, nek ba mi nɔɔk bafi Ícɛn-iduk ika. Ba da shesh kuwɔp ajɛrɛ me kufi nfɛn nsɔk nnaas ina faa (42). <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Ama anɔng, in bi nɔɔk bafi icɛɛt akuce hom bafaa agap itaas ifɛ́ hom, nfi nnom agup azining nɛ anakat afaa ni nsɔk karataat (1,260), ba da te alusuk áres.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Batan bafaa me, ba se tɛ atin ifat afaa nɛ ishɛn isaas agaramun afaa fɛ́ a nyeseng ashon aTisa azatse. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ke akak tsɛt a ka ba man, ni kurong nes na nu bá, ni ku hɛlɛm bafidang ifa bá me. Anɔng wu ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba tsɛsɛk ni ifa di kus. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Banet e yɔng bɛ́ agap ifaam kazanɛn, ba di ro ni iza ni izen fɛ́ ba se ni itaas ifɛ́ Adakunom; ba tɛ ba bɛ́ kukyem itirik ashi na a sot nasok, na ba rus kazatse na kaakyi kuri izot, ngma izen fɛ́ ba shim.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ama fɛ́ ba gang ncɛɛt bá, kunyam fi ku nes kubong fi kutsik ku se vit nkum, ku bi ra itsom ni ba, ni ku ka ba ya ni itsom e, ni ku ka ba fɛɛs. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Ni nkom bá, di wey naton irèn agbat iwɔp e, kuwɔp e tonong ti kusot aSodom nɛ aMasat, karɔ fɛ́ ba di tekak aTisa bá. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Ba sot azɔng nkɔs ntaat ni ibit, banet nes ni mben, nɛ alem, ni icɛ́n, ni ízɔrɔk, ba bɛ ba di ta ayisi ni nkom me, ba ro ni kunɛt ba. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Banet azatse bi feng na ba ra amok, ne ba nesek nnang nek iku bá me, nek batan bafaa me tang banet iyɔm azatse.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Awɛt ama nkɔs ntaat ni ibit e, nsong fi in ne na Adakunom nɔ ayɛt ba, ba tɛ ba dorok natak bá, nnyim kpa bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba di. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Ama anɔng, batan bafaa me fok kutɔ ne azanɛn, ku fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ngarak yin aze!&gt;&gt; Ba ma ngarak sak azanɛn ayɛt anɔk, na ayisi bafidang ifa bá.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ni izen e yɔng, ba nye agbat izuut mben makiyi, kabak kazining ayɛt kusɔk afi kuwɔp e kpa. Banet agup kanakataat kus ni izuut mben e, nnyim yit ishɛrɛp e, ba nɔɔk Adakunom azanɛn iratek.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Izot ifɛ́ afaa mi got yɔng; izot ifɛ́ ataat ngmash.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugba kufi kanakataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Atomaza afɛ́ kanakataat fɛɛp igba wu, ba fok ntɔ gbɛrɛy na azanɛn fi i nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">&lt;&lt;Igwɔm azatse kang mi sot ifɛ́ aTisa yit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">ni iwu Anet-Isheshek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">iwu da ya igwɔm e ayɛ nɛ ayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Bashɔn nsɔk nfaa ina naas, fɛ́ ba sosok ni ata igwɔm anu shon Adakunom, ba te gup ayisi bá, ba ku ya ntong. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />Na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Iyit da tere yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Ada Adakunom Azɔk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">ngɔn fi i se yɔkɔnɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">i tsang se yame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">nek i mi sok kukyem ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">i mi kpa ya igwɔm.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Banet icɛ́n azatse mi tsang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kana shining na naman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">awɛt yɔkɔnɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">izen naman ngɔn mi bɛ́.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Izen mi nye fi i da ra bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">fɛ́ ba mi kus ishɔt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ni ma nɔɔk basam ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">na batan ngɔn izang bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">na banet Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nɛ ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">inyim ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">babane, na baratek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Izen mi nye fɛ́ ba da wey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ngma bayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ba wey na kazatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ama anɔng, ba tarak kutu iya Adakunom ntong azanɛn, ayɛt itu me, ba di akwɔti irosom kushi me. Wat kaza kpa nye dɛbɛt, ni ntɔ, ni iza rus, ni mben zuut nɛ anyin aca-tarang kpas.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Abining e ni kuhwyen e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Agbat ikyɛng ayɔɔt ikak wuruk azanɛn: in di abining akak fɛ́ kunom fam kurɔm wu tɛ kukpin, ni kufɛn na ataas atak wu, nɛ ni ice wu abong igwɔm, fɛ́ a bɛ́ ádat kusɔk abe afaa. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />A bɛ́ kafa, na tos, na a ruus tɛ a bɛ́ bakat ites. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ama anɔng, ikyɛng ayɔɔt ikak ti i wuruk azanɛn: in di kuri kugbat kuhwyen kuseng kukak fi ku bɛ́ ice kanakataat, nɛ átom kusɔk, nɛ ábong igwɔm kanakataat naton ice ko. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Kurúm ko yɛs azining ayɛt asa ataat afɛ́ ádat azanɛn, a worok ina sak azatse. Kuhwyen e nyeseng ashon abining fɛ́ a shim a tes e, nɔng ku da bin ya nggon e ni izen ites ka. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />A tes nggon kamatek e, kayɔng fɛ́ ka da ya igwɔm azatse ngma ni ishɛn kutsɔm. Ba wat ba ta nggon e kyɛm sak na Adakunom, sak ni kuta igwɔm wu. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Abining e dorok a hwyet sak na tse sak narɔ fɛ́ Adakunom nye nek iwu, karɔ fɛ́ ba da ku fiis mo, nfi nnom agup azining na anakat afaa ni nsɔk karataat (1,260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Itsom dorok azanɛn. AMakyel nɛ batomaza wu ra itsom ni kuhwyen e, nɛ batom ko. Kuhwyen e nɛ batomaza ko ti ku bun ni itsom sak ni ba. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Awɛt ba ya kuhwyen e ni itsom e, iko nɛ batom ko bit karɔ isonong bá azanɛn. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Kugbat kuhwyen e kang, yet kuhwyen ayame yɔng fɛ́ ba yes iko amaan e, nɛ aShetan, kuyɔng fi ku wɔrɔk banet azatse ngma. Ba mi barak iko na batomaza ko sak azatse.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ama anɔng, in fok kutɔ gbɛrɛy azanɛn yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng isheshek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nɛ agap ni igwɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Adakunom yit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">ni kukyem Anet-Isheshek wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">mi bɛ́.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Ba mi barak afi itsɛsɛk inɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">baruneng yit sak aben,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">iwu fɛ́ a tsɛsɛk isɛ inɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">baruneng yit ashon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Adakunom yit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">kunom na katuk.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ba mi ya awɛng natoon wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">nek nasok Kitsamang e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ni kucɛɛt atsak fɛ́ ba taas;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">da ishim kutset bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ka ba sak nnyim iku awo.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Nek anɔng, nye yin ifeng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">iyin kazanɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt ka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Awɛt kawɛy se gung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">na kazatse nɛ izek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">nek amaan e mi tik sak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">aben ni yin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">A mi mos ne kafa kawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">nek a rēn fok izen wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kyɛk gyegyet.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ni izen fi kuhwyen e di ba mi ku ko wɔrɔk sak azatse, ku kpa di kuus abining fɛ́ a tes nggon kamatek e me. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Awɛt ba nɔɔk abining e akufabak afaa afɛ́ agbat akim, nɔng a di ki teng sak narɔ fɛ́ ba ku nye ne natse, karɔ fɛ́ ba sak ba da ku fiis mo nfi iyɛ taat ni bit, kɔn ihwyen e. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Wat kuhwyen e turung ashi nanu ko ti kukyɛk, nɔng ku da bin sok abining e. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Awɛt mben di sɛ abining e, in tarak kanu in ngɔnɔng kukyɛk fi kuhwyen e turung nanu ko. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Kuhwyen e nye kafa kawe makiyi na abining e, ku wat ku kpa tang itsom ni ishɛrɛp nnon abining e, bayɔng fɛ́ na foos ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ba yit kucɛɛt aYeso. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Kuhwyen e ma nyeseng naton nzɛk nanu kukyɛk e.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Kukyɛng ashi fi ku ne ni izek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Anɔng bà, in ti in di kukyɛng ashi fi ku wuruk ni izek e. Ku bɛ̀ átom kusɔk, nɛ ice kanakataat, kaakyi kutom bɛ́ abong igwɔm, nɛ kaakyi ice bɛ́ iyerek de, fi i yet ifi byɛs Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Kukyɛng ashi fi in di me tas agantuk, awɛt atak e se tɛ afɛ abuwa, na akpwɛrɛ asɔp, kanu me se tɛ ka fɛ́ akukum. Kunyin kuhwyen e kin nɔɔk kukyɛng ashi me agap ko, ni kuta igwɔm ko, ni kukyem ko makiyi. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ice kukyɛng ashi me izining kin bɛ̀ kufot kumaan e fi ku kyem ni ku wey ni ko, awɛt ku te kyang. Ikyɛng e te banet azatse ngma kpɔrɔk, ba kpa di kuus kukyɛng ashi me. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Banet e ya kunyin kuhwyen e ntong, nek iko ko ku nɔɔk kukyɛng ashi me agap ice. Banet tɛ ba ya kukyɛng ashi me ntong bà, nɛ ba nye, &lt;&lt;Angan wu a se nagbɔng ti kukyɛng ashi me yɛ? Angan da kyem a ra itsom ni ko yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Ba nɔɔk kukyɛng ashi me kawat itsot kukaa, ni itonoso ibyɛs sak na Adakunom, ni iya igwɔm nfi nfɛn nsɔk nnaas na nfaa. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Ku tarak kanu ku kpa tosong Adakunom, ni ku beseng iyerek wu, na karɔ isot wu, na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni kusot azanɛn. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Ba kin kuku nɔk kawat itsom na banet Adakunom, ni ku ka ba ya mo ni itsom. Ba tɛ ba kuku nɔk kukyem azaton kaakyi mben, ni kaakyi ilem, ni ícɛ́n, ni ízɔrɔk. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Ngma banet azatse ya kukyɛng ashi me ntong, ba yet bayɔng fɛ́ da ba jɛk ayerek bá ni kufumung kutset neme dang na ba nye kazatse awo, kufumung e yet kufi kitsamang e fɛ́ ba kin tsɛɛt.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kuto, won na a fok.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ba mi sak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a da tse ari inyang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a da ya inyang e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ba mi sak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">fok a da ku ni itsot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a da ku ni itsot e.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Nek anɔng, i se gbingbing banet Adakunom na ba nye kabɔk ayɛt isɔ izot, ni kusot atsak bá.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukyɛng fi ku ne aben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ama anɔng, in ti in di kukyɛng kak, fi ku ne aben. Ku bɛ̀ atom afaa tɛ afi itsamang, awɛt kucɛɛt ti kuhwyen. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ku ras kutomong ni kukyem kukyɛng ashi imɛsɛng e akuce ko. Ku sak kazatse nɛ banet fɛ́ ba se ayɛɛt ka, na ba ya kukyɛng kufi imɛsɛng e ntong, kuyɔng fɛ́ ba te kufot ko kyang. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ku ras ntomong ajingjing makiyi, na ayisi banet ngma, ku saas kurong nes naton aza ni ku kpas aben. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ku wɔrɔk banet azatse, nek ice fɛ́ ba ku ko nɔk fi ku di ras ntomong ajingjing na kuce kukyɛng ashi kufi imɛsɛng e me. Ku ka ba sak, na ba nok kubannom fi ku tas kukyɛng ashi me, fɛ́ ba kin maan iko ni kutsot, ngma na anɔng kuren se ni kutset, nɔng ba bin ku ko nesek iratek.<verse eid="REV 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Ba nɔk kukyɛng kufɛ́ afaa me ice fi ku di fɛɛp nsong kutset ayɛɛt kukyɛng fɛ́ ba nok e tɛ kukyɛng imɛsɛng e me, nɔng ku da kyɛm kucɛɛt, ni ku fɛɛs ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba dang na ba ku ko ya ntong. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ku tɛ ku sak na ba jɛk akaangan izizɔ ni bɔk iyak wu ke natii wu ayi, ke na ayet abaan e, ke agbat e, ke arum, ke akan, ke awashak, ke asam. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyɛm na shan kɛ na rɛp ikyikak tit a bɛ̀ izizɔ me yɔng, fi i yet iyerek kukyɛng e kɛ alamba iyerek ko ayi.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ideng ikyɛng tsɛt kutsitsɛng. Won ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ irēn, na a fa ifa kukyɛng e, nek iyet alamba anet awe, alamba ko me yet anakat karataat ni nsɔk karataat na karataat (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Kitsamang e na banet <optbreak /> fɛ ba yet bafuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />In di, Kitsamang e ni nyeseng ashon hom naton Ihwyanang aSihiyona, banet agup anakat azining ni nsɔk nnaas na anaas (144,000) kin se gung ni wu. Ba kin jɛk iyerek wu, ni ifɛ́ Ada wu na natii bá. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />In fok iwɔng ne azanɛn ti ifɛ́ ashi fɛ́ a tisik kpool, ti itasak íza. Iwɔng fin in fok e, se ti ifɛ́ anet fɛ́ a tsin kpereng izóm. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Ba ra abom afas ashon kuta igwɔm, nɛ ashon nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas e nɛ ashon bashɔn e. Vit akak fɛ́ a kyɛm a mees abom e, tit banet agup anakat azining ni nsɔk nnaas na anaas e (144,000) fɛ́ ba mi sɛ isheshek azatse. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ba bang wu, ba bereng ace bá cɛ́l, ba ki mang beseng nrɔm bá na banyining awo. Ba kuus Kitsamang e sak na kaakyɛ arɔ fɛ́ a di tses. Ba bang mi sɛ isheshek ayɛɛt banet azatse, ba mi sot inɔɔk kunang itusung nayak imɛsɛng sak na Adakunom ni Kitsamang e. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Vit mbɔɔs fɛ́ ba sɛ nanu bá, ba ka sɛ vit inɛn.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itom batomaza bataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Wat in di atomaza akak na tsin teng naton aza, a bi ifɛ̀ fi i se ayɛ na ayɛ, fɛ́ a da shara na banet fɛ́ ba se azatse, na kaakyi mben, ni ícɛ́n, ni ilem, ni izɔrɔk. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />A fɛrɛng ni kutɔ kuratek ye, &lt;&lt;Fok yin nnyim Adakunom, ni ku nesek yin iratek, nek izen ishɔt wu mi bɛ́. Ya yin ntong, sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a nye kazanɛn e, nɛ kazatse, ni izɛk, nɛ ákang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Atomaza afɛ́ afaa me, di kuus afi mɛsɛng e, a fɛ́ ye, &lt;&lt;A mi kpa! Agbat iwɔp aBabila mi kpa, iwu fɛ́ a sak ngma mben azatse sɔ ashi anap iririm wu, afi kujang wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Atomaza afɛ́ ataat e, ka ba kuus mo, a fɛrɛng ni kutɔ kuratek fok, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kunyam e ntong, nɛ kubannom fɛ́ ba nok tɛ nawu ko, a shan alamba ko natii wu, ke ni bɔk wu, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />iwu ma a bi sɔ ashi anap naman Adakunom, kuyɔng fɛ́ ba mi korok nyif ne agap karidɛ naman wu. A bi sɔ izot ayɛɛt asɛng aca-rong ashon batomaza ba jɛrɛ, ni Kitsamang e. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Atseng-iron izot bà, ngarak ayɛ nɛ ayɛ. Vit ifɔɔn katuk ni kunom, sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya ntong sak ni kukyɛng ashi me, ni kubannom fi ba nok na nawu ko, ke a shan alamba iyerek ko.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ideng shim banet Adakunom na ba sot na kabɔk, ni ifoos ifɛ̀ wu, ni inyeseng gbak ayɛɛt atsak na aYeso.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />In ti in fok kutɔ ne na azanɛn ye, &lt;&lt;Jɛk! Awɛng se gung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba kus nek ba yet bafɛ́ aTisa, azeng yɔkɔnɔng sak ashon.&gt;&gt; Kabik Adakunom fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ey! Ba bi fɔn ni mgbang bá, nek ba bi te burum ntomong ntek bá awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itusung nkyɔrɔk azatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Fi in se ni iyɛrɛ, in di anɔk akan, nɛ akak sonong naton anɔk e, &lt;&lt;Tɛ Arim Anet&gt;&gt;, na abong igwɔm kutsɔm kuseng ni ice wu, ni kuvotot kukot ni bɔk wu. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Wat atomaza akak ne narɔ iya Adakunom ntong e, a yes ayɔng fɛ́ a sonong na anɔk e ni kutɔ kuratek, a fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Sok kuvotot kukot ngɔn, di tusung nayak e, nek izen itusung nayak e mi nye, nek nayak azatse mi been.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Wat ayɔng fɛ́ a sonong naton anɔk e, a ziming kuvotot kukot wu naton kazatse, a tusung kuyak azatse me.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Atomaza me akak ne narɔ iya Adakunom ntong azanɛn, iwu bɛ̀ kuvotot kukot e bà. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ama anɔng, atomaza akak, fɛ́ a bi ice naton kurong, a ne ni kuta ashosh e, a yes atomaza fɛ́ a bereng kuvotot kukot e, ni kutɔ kuratek fok, &lt;&lt;Sok kuvotot kukot ngɔn, di tusung ice ica anap azatse, nek a mi ben.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Atomaza me a ziming kuvotot kukot wu me na azatse, a tusung ace anap e, a bara ina ni bong ifarang e, fi i tonong naman Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Ba shesh ide narɔ fɛ́ ba di farang ica anap ama iwɔp, nasok fɛ́ na nes ni bong e, kuzamang e bi se bakat karɔ fɛ́ ba di tes iguk itsaap, kuyikyik e bi se bakat amile anakat afaa.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Batomaza kanakataat <optbreak /> ni izoot igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />In di ikyɛng ayɔɔt ikak azanɛn, i yet iratek, ikyɛng ayɔɔt. Batomaza kanakataat da bɛ ni izot kanakataat ifi igang e, nek ni bɔk bá wu fɛ́ Adakunom di ki shining namaan wu na fi igang e. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />In ti di ikyɛng ikak ti izek fɛ́ ba di moon e fi i gyɛs tɛ agyilas, ni kurong. Bayɔng fɛ́ ba nyeseng bakat ni izek e, yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya awɛng naton kukyɛng ashi e, nɛ kubannom e, nɛ naton iyerek ko. Ba berese izóm fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba nesek, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />ba di ras abom aMusa asam Adakunom, nɛ afi Kitsamang e. Ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;ATisa, Ada, Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">agbat ntomong ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">yet ikyɛng ayɔɔt makiyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">AGwɔm mben azatse ngma!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Irén ngɔn se tabat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">i yet ifɛ́ atsak.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Wo aTisa, angan fɛ́ a da fok nnyim ngɔn awɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Angan fɛ́ a da nɔɔk iyerek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ngɔn iratek awɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ngɔn azingɔn wu fi i se jɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ngma icɛ́n banet azatse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">da bɛ́ ashon ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">na ba da ya ntong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">nek ngma banet mi di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ntomong ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">fi in se tabat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ama nnang, in di ba mi tarak kubut inɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ fi iyet karɔ iya Adakunom ntong nazanɛn. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Batomaza kanakataat e fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ni izoot kanakataat e wuruk ayɛt Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong. Ba tes nkpin alinen akan fin nɛp, ba rosom agwɔm bá na atoro atsɔm-aseng. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Wat akak ayɛt nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas yaame, nɔɔk batomaza kanakataat e ítsɛ́n atsɔm-aseng na fi izoot kanakataat fɛ́ na da ba shining ina ne naman Adakunom, fɛ́ a se ayɛ na ayɛ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong e wat ku shining nɛ atseng fɛ́ a ni ízɔk Adakunom, ni kukyem wu. Vit akak fɛ́ a kyɛm a nɔ ni Kutu Iya Adakunom Ntong e, ma ama fi izoot kanakataat ka fɛ́ batomaza kanakataat e mi gang.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Ítsɛ́n kanakataat ifɛ́ <optbreak /> naman Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />In fok kutɔ gbɛrɛy fi ku ne narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, ku fɛ́ na batomaza kanakataat e ye, &lt;&lt;Tseng in, ni ítsɛ́n fi i shining na naman Adakunom kanakataat e, korok yin ina azatse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Atomaza afi imɛsɛng e, tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsen ifuu azatse. Áduk ánot akak wuru na banet fɛ́ ba bɛ́ izizɔ kukyɛng ashi me, fɛ́ ba ku ko ya ntong.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Atomaza afɛ́ afaa, tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu ayet izek. Izek e tirik isot nasok tɛ anet fɛ́ ba fɛt, kaakyi ikyɛng fi i se ayɛt izek e kus.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Atomaza afɛ́ ataat, tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu naton ákyɛk nɛ ákang ashi, a tirik a sot nasok. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Wat in fok atomaza fɛ́ a bi ice naton ashi, a fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">&lt;&lt;Ngɔn aJɛrɛ Mɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">fi iras ishɔt atsak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">ngɔn fi i se yɔkɔnɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">fi i kin se neme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">nek ngɔn ras ishɔt anɔng.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Nek iba mi nos nasok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">anɔng nɛ batan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">ngɔn mi kaba nɔk nasok e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">ba sɔ ina kpaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">ti kushim ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Wat in fok kutɔ ne kuta ashosh e, ku fɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa Ada Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">ishɔt ngɔn se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">tabat na atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Atomaza afɛ́ anaas, a tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu naton kunom. Ba ma nɔɔk kunom e agap ni ku ta na banet vɛt ni kurong. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Nvɛɛt kurong e kaba shosh makiyi, fi i sak ba tosong iyerek Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a bi ice naton izot e. Ngma na anɔng, ba raba dang tirik ba wosong anɛn bá, ba ku nɔk mo iratek wu.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Atomaza afɛ́ atoon, a tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu ni kuta igwɔm kukyɛng ashi me, igwɔm ko wat i sot hwyining. Banet ros alem bá nek mgbang. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Ba tosong Adakunom azanɛn nek mgbang bá nɛ ánot bá, awɛt ba raba dang tirik ba wosong nduk nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba ras.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Atomaza afɛ́ karataat, a tse a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu naton kugbat kukyɛk aYuferetis. Ashi kukyɛk me wat a te jɔng, nɔng ku da nye irèn fɛ́ bágwɔm abace bi di got.<verse eid="REV 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ama anɔng, in di itséng itaat fi se tɛ ábót, a wuru na anu kunyin kuhwyen e, nɛ na nu kukyɛng ashi e, nɛ na nu atan mbɔɔs e. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ayet nabik ítseng, fi iras ntomong ajingjing. Ni itsees sak na bágwɔm azatse kang ngma kusum, nek i ka ba tusung mok itsom, agbat inom Ada, Adakunom fɛ́ a wat kaakyɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />&lt;&lt;Fok yin, imi yɔng in wuruk tɛ akpatang! Awɛng se gung ne ayɔng fɛ́ a di wey dang nda, na ares wu dang tun, kɔng a bi se kpiip ni nsum kudaam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Itséng e tusung bágwɔm e narɔ fɛ́ ba yes ika ni ilem baYahuda, Amagedon.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Atomaza afɛ́ kanakataat, a korok ikyɛng fi i se ni itsɛn ifuu ni wun. Wat kutɔ kukak kuratek ne narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, ni kuta igwɔm Adakunom, ku fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ba mi gang!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Wat alem aca-rong tang dɛbɛt, nɛ awɔng, ni izá tasak, ni mben izuut makiyi. Neme fɛ́ ba di nye anet awe, ba ma nye kuri izuut mben ti iyeng awo. Izuut iyeng iyet iduk-iduk e ngma. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Agbat kuwɔp aBabila kana kam asa ataat, ni nwɔp azatse ngma kusum kpas. Adakunom yiring na agbat iwɔp aBabila, a sak ba sɔ ashi anap ayɛt aridɛ aduk naman wu ma ba gang ina. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Kaakyɛ mben nate izek te bit, ngma ahwyanang te wɛrɛng. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Anyin ica itarang fi kunanang e se bakat ápang anakat azining,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ápang anakat azining</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Se nagbɔng ni kunanang kashining kazining ka fɛ́ asiminti.</char></note> a nes azanɛn, na a kpas naton banet, i sak banet e tosong Adakunom nek izot ica itarang e, kin yet iduk e.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Abining e ni Kunyam-ayit e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Azining ayɛt batomaza kanakataat e fɛ́ ba bereng ítsɛ́n kanakataat e, bɛ a fɛ́ ni mi: &lt;&lt;Bɛ, in da ka tonong izot fi kugbat kunyak-agwɔm e da sɔ, kuyɔng fi kusosok naton ashi dot. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Ni iko wu bágwɔm azatse di ras kujang, banet fɛ́ ba se azatse di feng na ashi anap afi kujang ko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Wat atomaza me di sok ayɛt abik sak na tse. Azɔng wu in tsin in di abining ni sonong naton inyam ikak isɛng kyiu, ba jirim iye na ayerek itok Adakunom. Inyam e bɛ́ àce kanakataat nɛ átom kusɔk. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Abining e kana zem na ares fi nse na se tɛ nasok, asɛng kyiu, a gyɛs nek atsɔm-aseng, nɛ ata itsɔm, ni nkyɔrɔk kurúm aben. A bereng itsɛn atsɔm-aseng ni bɔk wu fɛ́ ba di shining ni in gbɛk-gbɛk nkyɔrɔk nɛ amadɔm kujang wu. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin jɛk natii wu de:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 17:5">&lt;&lt;AGBAT ABABILA, NGGƆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 17:5">INYAK AGWƆM KUSUM,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 17:5">NGGƆ NGBƐK-GBƐK</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 17:5">NKYƆRƆK AZATSE.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />In di abining e mi feng ne nasok banet Adakunom, nasok bayɔng fɛ́ ba bereng kucɛɛt aYeso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Izen fi in di abining e, a di te yɔɔt. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Wat atomaza me fɛ́ ni mi: &lt;&lt;A da te yɔɔt akyɛ? Won in da ka tarak ikyɛng inɛt abining e ni inyam fɛ́ a ngarak iye, fi ibɛ àce kanakataat nɛ átom kusok e. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Kunyam-ayit fi ngɔn di yɔng, ku kin se neme, ku se vit kyɔrɔng, ku bi ti ku wuruk ni bong fi ku se vit nkum awo, ni ku ma tsɛng sak iwey ko. Banet azatse fɛ́ da bamang jɛk ayerek bà ni kufumung kutset neme ni itumung kazatse awo, ayɔɔt bi ka ba yit ni izen fɛ́ ba di kunyam-ayit e, nek ku kin se neme, ku se vit yɔkɔnɔng, ku bi ti ku bɛ.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Ikyɛng e deng tsɛt kutsitsɛng. Ace kanakataat e, yet ahwyanang kanakataat fɛ́ abining e di sosok ni na. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />A tɛ a yet bágwɔm kanakataat. Batoon ayɛt ba man kus, azining di se mo, azining resek dang bɛ. Izen fɛ́ a bɛ́, i se gbing-gbing na a ya igwɔm nfi kizen gyet. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Kunyam-ayit fi ku kin se yaame, ku se vit yɔkɔnɔng, ku yet agwɔm afi nkara. Iwu yet azining ayɛt kanakataat e, a yɔng a tseng sak iwey yuu.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Átom kusok fi ngɔn di me, a yet bágwɔm kusok fɛ́ ba resek dang shan igwɔm bà, awɛt fi ni igyip izining ba bi se kukyem tɛ bágwɔm ni kunyam-ayit e. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Ngma ba bi ite iyɛ izining, ba bi nɔɔk agap bà ni kukyem bà sak ni kunyam-ayit e. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ba bi tang itsom ni Kitsamang e, awɛt Kitsamang e bi ya awɛng naton ba, nek iwu yet aTisa bátisa nɛ agwɔm bágwɔm, a bi se gung nɛ bayɔng fi iwu ki mang yes, nɛ bayɔng fi iwu ki mang myak, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku kuus mo ayɛt atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Wat, atomaza me fɛ́ ni mi, &lt;&lt;Kudot ashi fi ngɔn di yɔng, fi inyak agwɔm e di sosok, a yet banet, kudyɛng banet, mben azatse, ni ìcɛn. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Kunyam-ayit nɛ átom kusɔk yɔng e fi ngɔn di, da raba inyak agwɔm e. Ba da ku won gbindis, na ba ku won kpiip; ba da ya inam wu, na ba ku shosh ni kurong. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Nek Adakunom mi sak na ayɛ bà, na ba shining kushim wu, ni irèn inyim ice bà ayɛt inɔɔk kunyam-ayit e agap iya igwɔm naton ba, sak izen ishining ifɛ́ Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Abining fi ngɔn di yɔng, yet agbat iwɔp e yɔng fi ku ya igwɔm azaton bágwɔm azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Ikpa aBabila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ama anɔng, in di atomaza akak a ne azanɛn na tsin tisik. A bi kukyem makiyi, kazatse wat ka shesheng nek ndɛp izɔk wu. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />A ta kutɔ gbɛrɛy makiyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">&lt;&lt;A mi kpa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Agbat aBabila mi kpa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">A mi sot kari ítseng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">nɛ kari akaakyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">kuri aduk abik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">nɛ kari ngma ngbɛk-gbɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">nkyɔrɔk nɛ nanon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">fɛ́ ba byɛn ina.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Nek ngma mben azatse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">mi sɔ ashi anap iririm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">kujang wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Bágwɔm azatse mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ras irɔs ni iwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">banet ijik azatse mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">tes kurúm ayɛt aduk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">kusot nta wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />In ti in fok fok kutɔ kukak fi ku ne azanɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Banet in, wuruk yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ayɛt wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">kɔn inɛn wu bi ki tat yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kɔn izot wu ikak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">bi kpa naton yin;<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />nek anɛn wu mi tse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">shining sak azanɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:5">Adakunom mi yiring</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">anyas ko.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />&lt;&lt;Ku nye yin kpaf ikyɛng fi iko kin ki nye yin e ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">ku nye yin ne sok kafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ikyɛng fi ko kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ki nye yin ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Ku ku gyɔrɔp yin itsɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ifaa ikyɛng fi ko kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ki nɔk yin.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ku tang yin iyɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ni mgbang makiyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">kpaf ni ízɔk ni nta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">fi iko kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">nesek ice ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ku tsosok kukaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ni iyɛ ko fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Imi sosok tɛ azɛnɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">imi yet akuma awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">imi bi di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ibeseng iyɛ awo.&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Nek anɔng, atuk azining,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">izot ko bi bɛ́ zɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">iku, nɛ kafa kawe, ni nzong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kurong bi ku ko ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">nek aTisa, Adakunom fɛ́ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">waat akaakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">bi ku tsɛɛt ishɔt.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ bágwɔm azatse fɛ́ ba mi ras kujang ni iwu, fɛ́ ba ya nta bà gung ni wu, bi di atseng kurong fi ku bi ku ya, ba bi tos na ba nye kafa kawe mok iwu. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Nek nnyim mgbang fɛ́ ba bi di na tsin sɔ, ba bi nyeseng yik-yik na ba tos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">&lt;Kawɛy! Kawɛy!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Kaa agbat iwɔp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Kaa aBabila, kuwɔp fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">ba foos ni iko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Ayɛt igyip izining,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">igang ngɔn wat ibɛ́!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />&lt;&lt;Banet ijik azatse bi tos nɛ kafa kawe naton ko nek vit ayɔng fɛ́ a tɛ a ka ba ras ijik <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />nkyɔrɔk ijik bà yet: atsɔm-aseng, nɛ atsɔm akan, nɛ ata itsɔm, nkyɔrɔk kurúm aben, ni nkpiin alinen, ni nzwey e, nɛ asiliki, nɛ asɛng kyiu, ni nkyɔrɔk nkɔn ntek zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, ni nkyɔrɔk anyi azɔkɔm zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt. Ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba sɛp na ákon aSitiron, ákon itsɔm, ngma nɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ ba nye na atsɔm, na atsɔm awe, nɛ ata inok fɛ́ a nɛp. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Ni nkyɔrɔk asinamɔn, ni nkyɔrɔk nkɔn ntek e, na amir, nɛ afirankinsen; nɛ ashi anap, nɛ name, ni mkpe ntek, nɛ alikama; ni inyak, ni ibon, ni itsaap, ni itsaap atsɔm, nɛ banet fɛ́ ba yet basam, ntset banet awe yɔng.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />&lt;&lt;Ba bi nye, &lt;Ngma nkyɔrɔk ntek fi i di tsɛt ice, in mi tsees, in da won. Ngma kurúm ngɔn ni nkyɔrɔk mgbep ngɔn mi beseng. Vit ngɔn ni i ti isɛ na!&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Banet ijik fɛ́ ba ku rɛɛs nkyɔrɔk e nang, fɛ́ ba tees kurúm ni wu, ba bi nyeseng yik-yik, nek nnyim mgbang fɛ́ a di se. Ba bi tos na ba nye kafa kawe <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />na ba tang nkun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">&lt;Kawɛy! Kawɛy!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">Kaa agbat iwɔp!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">Ngɔn fi ites alinen atek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nɛ ares azwey e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nɛ ares asɛng kyiu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">i gyɛs na atsɔm-aseng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nɛ ata itsɔm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">nɛ nkyɔrɔk kurúm aben!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ayɛt igyip izining,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:17">ngma kurúm ngɔn e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:17">mi beseng!&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">&lt;&lt;Ngma bafɛ́ akyɛ-ashi, nɛ bafi inɔɔs e, nɛ bafi ikɔk akyɛ-ashi me, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras ntomong ayɛt ashi, ba bi nyeseng yik-yik. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Izen fɛ́ ba bi di atseng kurong fɛ́ a bi ya kuwɔp e, ba bi nye, &lt;Vit kuwɔp fɛ́ ba ki mang nye tɛ agbat kuwɔp kang!&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Ba bi tang ntong na ice bà, ne ba tos ni ibeseng iyɛ, na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">&lt;Kawɛy! Kawɛy!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Kaa agbat iwɔp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">karɔ fɛ́ ngma batek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">akyɛ-ashi, di tes kurúm bà!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Ni igyip izining,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">kuwɔp e mi wey!<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Nye yin iyɛ ikan nek ika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ho kazanɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Nye yin iyɛ ikan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">nɛ batom, ne batan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Adakunom mi tsɛɛt ishɔt ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ikyɛng fɛ́ iwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">kin ki ra yin e.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ama anɔng, atomaza akak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">fɛ́ abanang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">a tehik kunyin kuta kukak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">fi kunanang ko se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ti kuta-ikɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">a barak iko ni izek, a fɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">&lt;&lt;Na agap anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">fɛ́ ba da worok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">agbat iwɔp aBabila sak aben,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ba bi tɛ ba ku sɛ awo.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Ba bi tɛ ba fok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">abom banet-izom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">nɛ bafɛ́ abom, nɛ́ bafi ihwyɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">nɛ bafɛ́ ágba ni ngɔn awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Vit anet kutomong mbɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">fɛ́ a bi tɛ a ne ayɛt ngɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Ba bi tɛ ba fok iwɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">kuta-ikɔɔ ayɛt ngɔn awo.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Mgbey agaramun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">bi tɛ aron ayɛt ngɔn awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Ba bi tɛ ba fok kutɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">amatek agwol</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">nɛ agwol e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ni ngɔn awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Banet ijik ngɔn, kin yet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">agbat bafi ijik azatse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">I kin wɔrɔk icɛn azatse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ne nadɔm ira kubok ngɔn.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ni iwɔp aBabila fɛ́ ba kin sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nasok batan Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nɛ nasok banet Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:24">ne ngma banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">fi i kin fɛɛs azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Halleluya yet abom awɛng azanɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ama anɔng, in fok iwɔng ikikak ti iwɔng kudyɛng banet azanɛn, ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">&lt;&lt;Halleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Isheshek, ni ízɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">nɛ agap yet afɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">Adakunom yit,<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />nek ishɔt wu se tabat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">nɛ atsak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:2">&lt;&lt;A mi mees kugbat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">kunyak-agwɔm e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">Ayɔng fɛ́ a beseng kazatse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">ni kujang wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">A mi tarang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">nasok basam wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ba tɛ ba tarak ntɔ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">&lt;&lt;Halleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Atseng fɛ́ a ne ni iwɔp e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">ngarak sak naton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">ayɛ na ayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Bashɔn nsɔk nfaa na anaas, ni nkyɔrɔk ntset nnaas e, kpa aben, ba ya Adakunom ntong, iwu fɛ́ a sonong ni ita igwɔm me. Ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">&lt;&lt;Anɔng, Halleluya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Wat kutɔ ne nita igwɔm e ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">&lt;&lt;Tere yin Adakunom yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ngma yin basam wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">iyin bayɔng fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ifoos yin nnyim wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">baratek nɛ babane!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Wat in fok kutɔ ti iwɔng kudyɛng banet, ti iwɔng ashi fɛ́ a tsin tisik, ti itasak íza, ni ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">&lt;&lt;Halleluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Nek aTisa Adakunom yit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">fɛ́ a wat kaakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">tsin ya igwɔm.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Won ni in feng yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ni iyɛ ikan in ku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">nɔk yit iratek!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Nek kuweneng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">Kitsamang e, mi bɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">agwol e mi kana nye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">gyat mok iwu.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Ba mi ku nɔk alinɛn atek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">fɛ́ a gyɛs cɛ́l,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">na a te ni irɔm.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(Alinɛn atek e nyeseng naton nggɔn ntabat nfɛ́ banet Adakunom.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Atomaza me fɛ́ ni imi, &lt;&lt;Jɛk: &lt;Awɛng se na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba rini sak ni kuweneng iyak Kitsamang e!&gt; &gt;&gt; Atomaza e, bang fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifɛ̀ Adakunom ifɛ́ atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ni ifok anɔng, in kpa natak wu, in da ku ya ntong. Awɛt iwu fɛ́ ni imi, &lt;&lt;I bi nye anɔng awo! Imi yet afi ifiri ni ngɔn ayɛt isam, nɛ barunyining fɛ́ ba bereng ifɛ̀ aYeso. Ya Adakunom ntong! Nek kucɛɛt fɛ̀ banet taas gbɛngɛrɛng naton aYeso nes na abik Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anet isɔkɔ naton itsaap ikan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />In di kazanɛn piyot, azɔng ashon hom, in di itsaap ikan, ayɔng fɛ́ a se naton e, ba ku yes aFi iTak ni iShining, Anet aTsak. Na atsak, a ras ishɔt, ni iras itsom. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ica ayisi wu se ti ilem irong, ice wu bɛ́ ábong igwɔm dot. A bi iyerek fɛ́ ba jɛk natoon wu fɛ́ vit ayɔng fɛ́ a rēn ide, tit iwu aziwu. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />A te kukpin fɛ́ ba te iko ayɛt nasok, iyerek wu yet Ifɛ̀ Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Batsom azanɛn ku kuus mo ama, ba ngarak ítsaap ikan, ba tes ares alinɛn atek, akan cɛ́l. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ítsot fi iya votot, wuru nanu wu, iyɔng fɛ́ ba di ki kperek mben azatse. &lt;&lt;A bi ya igwɔm natoon ba, ni ishɛn kutsɔm.&gt;&gt; A bi shesh ica anap naman Ada, Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ba jɛk iyerek wu ni nkpiin, ni ishitak wu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 19:16">AGWƆM BÁGWƆM, NE ATISA BÁTISA.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ama anɔng, in di atomaza, ni nyeseng ayɛt kunom. A ta kutɔ na agap a di yes nanon aton aza ye, &lt;&lt;Bi kana tusung yin, nek amok aratek afɛ́ Adakunom, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />nɔng i da ya yin inam bágwɔm, nɛ agbat batsom, ne agbat banet, ni ifi ítsaap, nɛ bafi ingarak e, ni inam banet ngma, bawashak e, nɛ basam, nɛ babaan e nɛ baratek e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Wat in di kukyɛng ashi, nɛ bágwɔm azatse, nɛ batsom bà, kana tusung nek ira itsom na ayɔng fɛ́ a se naton itsaap ikan e nɛ batsom wu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Awɛt ba tekap kukyɛng ashi me, gung nɛ atan mbɔɔs wu fɛ́ a ras ntomong ajingjing akuce kukyɛng ashi me. Ni ntomong wu me fɛ́ a di sɔ ice bayɔng fɛ́ ba shan izizɔ ko, ba di ya kubannom ntong. Ba barak kukyɛng ashi me ni atan mbɔɔs e, ni kutset ayɛt kubong árong fɛ́ a turung abing-irong-iruk. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Ba fɛɛs ishɛrɛp ba ni itsot fi ines nanu ayɔng fɛ́ a se naton itsaap e, ngma nanon e tse na ya ikyɛng fɛ́ na da kyem na ya kyɛk.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Ayɛ agup azining afi <optbreak /> iya igwɔm aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />In di atomaza akak na tsin tisik, a ne azanɛn, a bereng kufet itarak katitu ibong fi ise tsik vit nkum, a bereng inyang iratek ni bɔk wu. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />A kɔrɔk kuhwyen e, kuhwyen kuzen ayame me, fi ku yet amaan e, ke aShetan ayi. A rosom iko ayɛ agup azining. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />A barak iko ayɛt kubong fi kutsik ko se vit nkum e, a te kpaf, a di basak nagang-ice-igwɔm, a ku ko ro ni iwɔrɔk banet azatse, tit ma ama ayɛ agup azining e shining. Ama anɔng, ba bi ne ba ku ko nɔɔk kawat nfi kizen gyet.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />In di ata igwɔm, bayɔng fɛ́ ba di sosok ni na yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba nɔɔk kukyem ira ishɔt. In di nabik bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin tɛsɛng ice bà mok itot ifɛ̀ aYeso, ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom. Bayɔng fɛ́ da ba mang ya kukyɛng ashi me, ni kubannom wu ntong awo. Iba fɛ́ da ba kin shan izizɔ wu na natii bà, ni ni mbɔk bà awo. Ba mi tɛ ba sɛ kutset, ba tsin ya igwɔm na Anet-Isheshek ayɛ agup azining. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Ishɛrɛp bafaben dorok awo, tit ma ayɛ agup azining e shining.) Idoro bafaben ifi imɛsɛng yɔng. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Awɛng nɛ ajɛrɛ yet afɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi se ni idoro bafaben ifi imɛsɛng e. Iku ifɛ́ afaa bɛ̀ agap naton bá awo, awɛt iba bi yet áware Adakunom nɛ Anet-Isheshek. Ba bi ya igwɔm ni wu ayɛ agup azining.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawɛy fɛ́ ka tsin tot aShetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ama fɛ́ ayɛ agup azining e mi gang, ba bi bisik aShetan na ari inyang e. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />AShetan e bi wuruk, nɔng i da bin wɔrɔsɔ mben azatse na atsok anaas afɛ́ azatse, fɛ́ ba yet aGog nɛ aMagog, nek ira itsom. Kudot banet e bi se ti izɛk anu izek. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Ba nes na narɔ zizɛɛt azatse, ba te karɔ isot banet Adakunom nate, kuwɔp fi iwu shim ko. Awɛt kurong ne azanɛn ku ka ba ya hwyii. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Awɛt amaan e, fɛ́ a ka ba wɔrɔsɔ, ba ku worok ni kubong árong fɛ́ a ya na abing-irong-iruk, karɔ fɛ́ ba kin di worok kukyɛng ashi nɛ atan mbɔɔs e. Ba da ka ba nesek izot kunom na katuk, ayɛ na ayɛ.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishɔt igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Wat in di kuta igwɔm kukan e, ayɔng fɛ́ a sonong ni ko. Kazatse nɛ kaza wat ka te bit ashon wu, ba bit karɔ inyeseng ni ba. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />In di bafaben, baratek nɛ babane, ni nyeseng ashon kuta igwɔm e. Ba tarak afumung, ba tɛ ba tarak kufumung kukak, kuyɔng fi ku yet kufumung kutset. Ba ras bafaben ishɔt, kpaf ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba raas, fi i se ni ijɛk na afumung e. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Izek turung nkom banet fi nse ayɛt na, iku nɛ ari-irong nesek bafaben fɛ́ ba se ni na, kaakyɛ anet ba ku ra ishɔt kpaf ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi ra. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ama anɔng, ba sok iku ni ari-irong sak ni kubong árong. Kubong árong e yet iku ifɛ́ afaa. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da ba sɛ iyerek wu ni jɛk ayɛt kufumung kutset e awo, ba ku barak ni kubong irong e.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Kazanɛn kafas nɛ kazatse kafas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />In di kazanɛn kafas nɛ kazatse kafas, nek kazanɛn imɛsɛng e nɛ kazatse imɛsɛng e mi tsang got, izek ti di se awo. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />In ti in di Kuwɔp aJɛrɛ, fi ku yet aRushelima afas, fi ku tsin tisik fi i ne azanɛn arɔ Adakunom. Ba ku nye gyat tɛ agwol fɛ́ a tsin tot amatek agwol wu. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />In fok kutɔ kuratek fi ku ne ni kuta igwɔm e, ku fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Di, yɔkɔnɔng, Adakunom mi te karɔ isonong wu na banet, a da sot gung ni iba. Iba da sot banet wu, na Adakunom ice wu sot gung ni iba, ni iba ku ya ntong.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />A bi ka ba rɛng ngma nayisi na ayisi bá. Iku da ti di se awo, ke kafa kawe, ke kanak, ke npep ikyikak, nek nkyɔrɔk in yame mi tsang got.<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni sonong ni kuta igwɔm e, a fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng, in da nye kaakyi ikyɛng ifas!&gt;&gt; A tɛ a fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;Jɛk ideng, nek kucɛɛt kang yet atsak, i se anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />A tɛ a fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;I mi gang! Imi yet Alfa nɛ aOmega, afi Imɛsɛng e ni Gang e. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fok iyɛ ngash, in da ku nɔɔk ashi isɔ fɛ́ a nes ni ikang-ashi kutset, ninang. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya agap imaas e, a da ya itekari nkyɔrɔk nang, imi da sot Adakunom wu, ni iwu sot arim hom. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Awɛt bafi nnyim, na bafɛ́ avit nɔɔk atsak na aYeso, na bafɛ́ iras nkyɔrɔk ngbɛk-gbɛk, na bafi ifɛs banet, na bafɛ́ iras kujang, na bafi iras kubok mbɔɔs, na bafi iya nabannom ntong, nɛ ngma bafi mbɔɔs, karɔ bá yet kubong abing-irong-iruk. Ideng de iyet iku ifɛ́ afaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">ARushelima afas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Azining ayɛt batomaza kanakataat e fɛ́ ba bereng ítsɛ́n kanakataat fɛ́ ba shining ina ni izot kanakataat na fi gang e, a bɛ́ ni imi, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́, in da ka tonong agwol e, abining Kitsamang e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Wat Kabik Adakunom tik naton hom, atomaza di sok sak ni iriyɔng ihwyanang iratek, a di tonong Kuwɔp aJɛrɛ, aRushelima tsin tisik fɛ́ ne azanɛn narɔ Adakunom. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Ku nɛp ni mgbey ízɔk Adakunom, mgbey wu se ti kuta itsom dot, tɛ ajasfa, fi ise gyiri tɛ agyilas. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ka bɛ̀ agbat kafat fi ise zamang gyet awo, na natitu kusɔk abe afaa, na batomaza kusɔk abe afaa fɛ́ ba yɛrɛ na natitu me. Ba jɛk ayerek izít aIsrela kusɔk abe afaa na natitu me. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Na kaakyɛ kabak natitu na taat di se, na taat na kabak itarak kunom, na taat abak ice, na taat abatin, nɛ na taat abak ikpa kunom. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ba ta itis inok kafat kuwɔp e ne ata itis kusɔk abe afaa, ni ina ayerek batom-aYeso fɛ́ a yet Kitsamang di se.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Atomaza me yɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni imi, a bi kishɛn imaas isop fɛ́ ba nye ni kutsɔm kuseng, nɔng a da maas kuwɔp e, nɛ natitu me, nɛ abat e. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ba kin ta itis kuwɔp e na nabak e se nagbirigbɔng, ngma ni kusɔp ni kugbey e. Atomaza me maas kuwɔp e ni kishɛn imaas wu, a sɛ bakat agup afaa na anakat kusɔk a bɛ afaa (12,000) afi kusɔp e, ni kugbey e, ni kuzamang e me, ngma na na se nagbirigbɔng. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Atomaza me maas kubat e, a sɛ kusɔp e se bakat amita anakat nsɔk nnaas ina anaas (144), ni irèn fɛ́ banet di maas narɔ.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ba nok kubat e na ata itsɔm dot fɛ́ ba yes ajasfa, ba nok kuwɔp e na atsɔm-aseng fɛ́ asas, fɛ́ a se gyiri tɛ agyilas. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ba jirim afam-bat itis kuwɔp e, na kaakyɛ kuri ata fɛ́ asas makiyi. Kufi imɛsɛng e, ba nok ba jirim na ajasfa, kufɛ́ afaa ba jirim na asafaya, kufɛ́ ataat ba jirim na akalsedoni, kufɛ́ anaas ba jirim na aemeral (fɛ́ a se tɛ ashi afumung). <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />Kufɛ́ atoon ba jirim na asaronis (a se ti intongkan), kufɛ́ karataat ba jirim na akarneliyan (fɛ́ a yet asɛng), kufɛ́ kanakataat ba jirim na akrisolat (fɛ́ a se tɛ ato afumung azwey e). Kufɛ́ nkara ba jirim na aberil (fɛ́ a se gigyel), ifɛ́ agyɛng-ataat na atofas, ifi kusɔk na akirisofuras, ifi kusɔk abe azining na ajasin, ni ifi kusɔk abe afaa na ametis. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Ba nye natitu kusɔk abe afaa me ne ata itsɔm, kaakyɛ katitu bɛ̀ kuzam ata itsɔm e kuzining fi ba nye kusas. Agbat irèn iwɔp e, ba nye iye na atsɔm-aseng wɔɔn na, fɛ a gyɛs gyiri tɛ agyilas.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />In di kutu iya Adakunom ntong afi iwɔp e awo, nek aTisa Adakunom fɛ́ a wat kaakyɛ ngma, ni Kitsamang e, iba ba ba yet karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Kuwɔp e ti ku tsɛt kunom, ke kufɛn ni ku ka ba nɔk mgbey awo, nek ízɔk Adakunom yet mgbey ko, ni Kitsamang e yet agaramun ko. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Ngma banet mben azatse da teng ba kaat ayɛt mgbey iwɔp e, bágwɔm azatse ngma bi bɛ́s ni mgbep ba ni kuwɔp e. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Vit kunom fɛ́ ba bi fam natitu inɔɔs ni iwɔp e, nek vit katuk azɔng awo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Ba bi bɛ́ ni ízɔk ni iratek mben azatse ngma sak ni iwɔp e. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Vit ikyɛng fi i se gbiridik fi i bi nɔ ni iwɔp e, ke afi iras nkyɔrɔk nsum, ke bafi mbɔɔs ayi. Tit bayɔng fɛ́ ayerek bá di se ni jɛk ni kufumung kutset, kufi Kitsamang bi nɔ azɔng.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Kukyɛk ashi kutsɛt e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Wat atomaza me di tonong kukyɛk fi ku nesek ashi kutset, fi ku gyɛs gyiri tɛ agyilas. Ashi me nes ni kuta igwɔm Adakunom ni Kitsamang e, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />ku gosok nate agbat irèn iwɔp e. Na kaakyɛ abak kukyɛk e, kakon inesek kutset di se, ka tes ica nri kusɔk abe afaa, ka korok ica me kaakyi kufɛn. Afumung ákon e yet ikan ites mben azatse kyang. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ba bi tɛ ba sɛ ite kawɛy ni wɔp e awo. Kuta igwɔm Adakunom ni Kitsamang e bi se ni wɔp e, basam wu bi ku ya ntong. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Ba bi di ayisi wu, ni iyerek wu bi se na natii bá. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Ba da tɛ ba sɛ katuk azɔng awo. Ba bi tsɛt mgbey agaramun ke nfi kunom azɔng awo, nek aTisa Adakunom bi sot mgbey bá. Ba bi ya igwɔm ayɛ na ayɛ.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ngmash na a tɛ a bɛ́</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Atomaza me fɛ̀ ni imi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:6">&lt;&lt;Ifɛ̀ deng yet ikyɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:6">ite iyɛ nɛ atsak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:6">ATisa, Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:6">afɛ́ nabik batan wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 22:6">a tom atomaza wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:6">na a tonong basam wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:6">nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ gbingbing</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:6">ngmash nin te.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />AYeso fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Di yin, imi yɔng ngmash ni in bɛ́! Awɛng se gung na ayɔng fɛ́ a tot ifɛ̀ batan fi i se ni kufumung kang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Imi, aYohana, imi wu fi in fok, in di nkyɔrɔk nang. Izen fi in mi fok, in mi di ina bá, in kpa gururuk natak atomaza fɛ́ a di tonoso nkyɔrɔk e nang, nɔng in ku ya ntong. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Awɛt iwu fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;I bi nye anɔng awo! Imi yet afi ifiri ni ngɔn nɛ barunyining batan, nɛ ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba tot ifɛ̀ kufumung kang. Ya Adakunom aziwu ntong!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />A tɛ fɛ̀ ni imi, &lt;&lt;I bi nɛt ifɛ̀ Adakunom fi i se ni kufumung kang awo, nek izen e bɛ́ bakat. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a ras anyas, na ya kashon ni iras anyas wu; won ayɔng fɛ́ a ras ngbɛk-gbɛk nkyɔrɔk; na ya kashon ni iras ngbɛk-gbɛk nkyɔrɔk wu; won ayɔng fɛ́ a ras nkyɔrɔk ntek, na ya kashon ni iras nkyɔrɔk ntek e, won ayɔng fɛ́ a se jɛrɛ, na ya kashon ni kusot jɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />AYeso fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Di yin, imi yɔng ngmash ni in bɛ́! Izang hom se ni imi, In da nɔɔk kaangan kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ a ra. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Imi yet Imɛsɛng nɛ afi Igang, afi Imɛsɛng e ni Igang e, afi Itumung e ni Nkum e.<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba kus ares bá, nɔng ba bin sɛ irèn sak na kakon inesek kutset, a da nɔ atisi kuwɔp e. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ákabu fɛ́ a se ama iwɔp e, yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kubok, ni kujang, nɛ́ bafi ifɛɛs banet, nɛ bafi ya nabannom ntong, nɛ ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba shim iras mbɔɔs. <verse eid="REV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Imi, aYeso, in tom atomaza hom, na a da taas nkyɔrɔk nang nek bafi ikuus. Imi yet Aney, ni Izɔrɔk aDauda, nɛ mgbey Àdat Isɛng Atson.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Kabik Adakunom e nɛ́ agwol e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; Won ayɔng fɛ́ a foos, na fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́!&gt;&gt; Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos iyɛ ngash, won na a bɛ́; ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim, won na a bɛ́ na shan kunang ashi fɛ a nesek kutset.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />In tsin kɔrɔk ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos kucɛɛt Adakunom fi i se ni kufumung kang ato: Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di barang ikikak ni na, Adakunom da ku barang izot fɛ́ ba jɛk ni kufumung kang. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kyɛk ikikak ni kufumung ifɛ́ Adakunom kang, Adakunom da shan kanu kafuu ne kakon fɛ́ ka nesek kutset, ni nfi kuwɔp ajɛrɛ, fi ba tonong ni kufumung kang.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a tsin taas kucɛɛt kang, fɛ́, &lt;&lt;Ey, Imi ngmash nin bɛ́.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Anɔng. Bɛ́, aTisa aYeso.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Won itek aTisa aYeso ni i se gung na banet Adakunom. Anɔng.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>